+ * as the main view, and its `eventSource` is the same durable event window the
+ * conversation assembles from. Reading `tool/call`, `tool/result`,
+ * `user/message`, and `turn/end` off that window gives the fold live starts
+ * with no DOM polling, no window global, and no second copy of conversation
